# Copy to .env.scripts (here, or in the superproject when this is a submodule).
#
# NO FALLBACK to the app's Supabase project is permitted, and that is a fix
# rather than an oversight: with one in place, an unset CATALOG_SUPABASE_URL made
# the production household database the default target of every load, with
# nothing between it and a service-role write but a printed hostname.
CATALOG_SUPABASE_URL=
CATALOG_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
